Model checkpoints
    QCR checkpoints are derivatives of Qwen3-VL-8B-Instruct and are distributed
    under, and subject to, the upstream Qwen license and usage terms. Users must
    comply with the Qwen license in addition to the terms above.

Third-party components (e.g., baselines and evaluators such as MD-VQA, DOVER,
DINOv2, CLIP, BLIP-2, UniVTG, Moment-DETR, and QD-DETR) retain their own
upstream licenses.

By using any artifact in this repository, you agree to comply with the
applicable license terms above.
